  {
   "symbol": "N",
   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "text": "Rami —\n\nIf anything happens tonight, where do I listen for you?\n— M.\n\n(Underneath, in Rami's handwriting:)\n104.4. Only you know it. Don't tell Hale. Don't tell anybody.\nAnd Mira — if it's me but it doesn't sound like a joke, it isn't me.",
    "title": "Sticky note on the storeroom shelf"
   },
   "sequence": -1,
   "lines": -1
  },
  {
   "symbol": "Q",
   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "flag": "mira_p3",
    "text": "Loop 1,906.\n\nI've tried every frequency on the set. 96.1 is the only one that ever answers, and it is always someone who isn't there.\n\nTonight somebody answered and said his name was Arlen. Arlen. I've heard that name before — it asked Hale for an Arlen, weeks ago. Before all this.",
    "title": "Mira's notebook — page 3 of 5"
   },
