   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "text": "To whoever is on comms tonight:\n\nI read the storeroom code out on my 'numbers station' test, 99.7, every night at 02:00, because SOMEBODY (Mira) keeps locking herself out.\n\nHale says this is a security breach.\nI say it's a numbers station, and numbers stations are cool.\n\n— R.H.",
