      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Run eighteen. I'm recording in the comms office because I don't want Marcus to hear this yet."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_03249026d8"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "The correspondent asked for someone by name tonight. Not one of us. It said 'Arlen'. Clearly. Twice. In Tunde's voice."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_44cfba9aa8"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "There is no Arlen on site. There is no Arlen in the Directorate. I've checked every file we have."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_bd69884927"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Mira thinks it's a word it has stitched together out of pieces. I don't. I think it's a name it hasn't heard yet. I think it remembers forward."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_388a5a6fac"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Danny laughed when it said it. He laughed, and he reached for the speaker."
